course: dictionary
lesson: 10805
title: Variety: many different kinds
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Variety means having many different kinds of things, not all the same. A menu with variety has lots of choices. The saying «variety is the spice of life» means that having lots of different things makes life more interesting.
explain: A variety of something is a number of different kinds of it. «A variety of fruit» means apples, pears, bananas and more, not just one kind. A variety of does not tell you an exact number. It only tells you there are several different ones.
explain: A variety can also be one particular type of plant or animal. «A new variety of apple» means one special kind of apple, and scientists use the word this way too.
explain: Writers use variety to keep their writing interesting. «Using a fronted adverbial in every sentence makes writing sound clunky; use them for variety.» The writer wants different sentence starts so the reader does not get bored.
fact: Variety means having many different kinds of things, not all the same.
fact: «A variety of» means several different ones, and it does not give an exact number.
fact: A variety can mean one particular type of plant or animal, such as «a new variety of apple».
fact: «For variety» means doing or using something different so that things do not get boring.
fact: A variety show is entertainment made of many short acts, like songs, jokes and magic.
exercise: «She ate a variety of fruit at the picnic.» What does a variety of mean here? | Only apples | A very long walk | *Several different kinds | Exactly one kind
exercise: Which phrase names one particular type of plant? | A variety of flowers | Variety show | *A new variety of rose | For variety
exercise: Mia wears a different hat each day for variety. Why does she do this? | To count her hats | To hide from the rain | Because hats are cheap | *To make things less boring
test: Which word means many different kinds, not all the same? | Boring | Single | Same | *Variety
test: Which is a variety show? | *A show made of many short acts like songs, jokes and magic | A quiet show with no sound | A show about the weather | A show with one long play
exam: In «variety is the spice of life», what is the saying telling us? | Only one kind of food is best | Life is always the same | Spices should be used in every meal | *Having lots of different things makes life more interesting
